## Word budget

| | Words |
|---|------:|
| **Target** | 3,000–3,500 |
| **Hard cap** | 4,000 main text |
| **Count** | `cd docs/paper && texcount -inc -1 plos_my_paper.tex` |

**Methods ~1,100 w is enough.** Add words in **Results and discussion** until the adequacy checklist passes. Move detail to SI rather than exceed 4,000.

**Concision:** one idea per paragraph; cite Fig/Table/SI instead of re-explaining; every sentence must add a number, protocol step, or interpretation.

