## Prose rules (summary)

See [`oliver-thesis-plos-writing.mdc`](oliver-thesis-plos-writing.mdc) for voice. Additionally:

- **British English**, impersonal Methods/Results.
- **No hype** — avoid “powerful framework”, “rich representation”, “explicitly captures”.
- **No invented numbers** — `holdout_ladder.csv`, `biology_meeting_population/`, or mark pending.
- **Scope in sentence 1 or 2** of every Results paragraph — joint / within-lab / fold 4 / population.
- **ML framing** — distribution shift, label noise, nuisance factors — in plain words, not jargon stacks.

