## Figure caption standard

```
\textbf{[Title].}
\textbf{A,} [what, population, n].
\textbf{B,} [what].
[One short interpretation sentence.]
[Scope: holdout fold 4 or population 20 mice; K and seed if needed.]
```

Captions may use panel colons; main text may not.

